# Which HCAL retroactive-gain-correction file covers which real-event
# date range. Read top to bottom at runtime; the first matching row wins.
#
# Columns: startDate endDate filename
#   startDate/endDate: YYYYMMDD, startDate inclusive / endDate exclusive
#   (same [begin,end) convention St_db_Maker/StDbLib uses elsewhere in
#   this project). filename is relative to this folder.
#
# Currently a single placeholder period spanning all of Run 22 with a
# deliberately generous margin (the real data-taking window is ~2021-12-21
# through ~2022-04-18, see GeometryPlayground/README.md and
# SpinPlayground/README.md) -- harmless to over-cover since every factor
# in the placeholder file is 1.0 (a no-op). Once real per-tower HCAL gain
# corrections are measured for specific sub-periods, replace this single
# row with multiple narrower ones, each pointing at its own real
# correction-factor file (see this folder's README.md).
20211201 20220701 hcal_gain_corr_run22_placeholder.txt
